#  🔍 PHASE 1: RECON & ENUMERATION
##  🧪 Check if Accounts Exist (No Kerberos)

nxc ldap <IP> -u users.txt -p '' -k

Purpose: Identify valid usernames
MITRE: T1071 – LDAP Recon

## 👥 Enumerate Users

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --users
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --active-users

MITRE: T1087 – Account Discovery

## 🔎 LDAP Queries

nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --query "(sAMAccountName=target)" ""

